    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis well presented one bedroom apartment is situated in the popular Academy Court development in Kildare Town. Located within a secure gated complex, the property offers comfortable, modern living in a convenient location.\n\nThe apartment is presented in turn key condition. The accommodation is well maintained, with a modern bathroom and a practical layout ideally suited to first time buyers, investors or those looking for a low-maintenance home.\n\nAcademy Court is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities. Kildare Town also benefits from excellent transport links, making commuting and access to surrounding areas convenient."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.455 x 1.380\nTiled floor\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 4.837x 3.858\nLaminate wooden flooring.Curtains & PoleElectric storage heater\n\nKitchen - 1.893x 2.240\nFitted floor and wall units Tiled floor and splashback.Stainless steel shelving.Oven, hob, extractor.Filter tap\n\nInner hall - 1.774 x 1.018\nLaminate wooden floor.\n\nBedroom - 4.846 x 2.708\nLaminate wooden floor.Electric storage heater.Built in wardrobe.Airing press.Sliding Patio Door\n\nBathroom - 1.176 x 1.697\nTiled floor & wallWalk in shower.Vanity sink unit.Toilet.Extractor fan\n\n"
      },
